      "code": "size_t hdrLen = getHeaderLen();\nif (m_DataLen <= hdrLen || hdrLen == 0)\n    return;\n\niphdr* ipHdr = getIPv4Header();\n\nProtocolType greVer = UnknownProtocol;\nProtocolType igmpVer = UnknownProtocol;\nbool igmpQuery = false;\n\nuint8_t ipVersion = 0;\n\nuint8_t* payload = m_Data + hdrLen;\nsize_t payloadLen = m_DataLen - hdrLen;",
      "note": "First project statement on the vulnerable path that materializes the attacker-controlled GRE byte slice and its length from the raw IPv4 packet tail.",
      "kind": "source"
